  <trk>
    <name>Walk 73.5 Darvel to Long Cairn walk, Loudoun Hill.</name>
    <desc>Walk from Darvel to Long Cairn and on to Loudoun Hill to climb to the summit. Returning to Darvel along route of old railway.</desc>
